<title>USA: VSI Enterprises names Brewer president.</title>
<headline>VSI Enterprises names Brewer president.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>VSI Enterprises Inc said Tuesday it had named Bill Brewer as president and chief operating officer and Leo Cortjens as chief technical officer.  </p>
<p>It said Brewer would still remain chief executive officer of subsidiary Integrated Network Services Inc, a post he has held since July 1994.</p>
<p>VSI, which makes systems for video conferences, said Brewer was replacing Cortjens, whose new posting had been recently created.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
